{
  "source": "Prompts/big-upside-3.mp4",
  "duration": 183.9949375,
  "segments": [
    {
      "start": 0.0,
      "end": 5.86,
      "text": "We often talk about AI as a giant calculator, running math at a scale nobody can picture."
    },
    {
      "start": 6.64,
      "end": 11.42,
      "text": "But when you apply that massive computing power to the physical world, the benefits"
    },
    {
      "start": 11.42,
      "end": 13.24,
      "text": "extend far beyond a laboratory."
    },
    {
      "start": 13.82,
      "end": 15.9,
      "text": "They're happening right now, across disciplines."
    },
    {
      "start": 17.54,
      "end": 23.42,
      "text": "Your body relies on proteins, tiny machines doing countless jobs, from carrying oxygen"
    },
    {
      "start": 23.42,
      "end": 24.72,
      "text": "to fighting infections."
    },
    {
      "start": 25.22,
      "end": 29.62,
      "text": "A protein's specific shape dictates exactly what job it can do."
    },
    {
      "start": 30.46,
      "end": 35.04,
      "text": "Knowing that shape helps scientists understand how a disease works, and look for new medicines"
    },
    {
      "start": 35.04,
      "end": 35.66,
      "text": "to treat it."
    },
    {
      "start": 36.34,
      "end": 40.94,
      "text": "For decades, mapping out those complex shapes was slow and difficult work."
    },
    {
      "start": 41.64,
      "end": 45.06,
      "text": "Today, computing power hands researchers a massive head start."
    },
    {
      "start": 45.78,
      "end": 48.44,
      "text": "Looking at this breakdown, we see the historical baseline."
    },
    {
      "start": 49.12,
      "end": 53.42,
      "text": "About 200,000 protein structures determined through decades of experiments."
    },
    {
      "start": 53.94,
      "end": 56.16,
      "text": "Below that is the computational leap."
    },
    {
      "start": 56.78,
      "end": 60.68,
      "text": "Over 200 million protein structures predicted and shared free."
    },
    {
      "start": 61.44,
      "end": 64.2,
      "text": "But remember, a prediction isn't a finished medicine."
    },
    {
      "start": 65.14,
      "end": 67.56,
      "text": "Scientists still have to test ideas and do the research."
    },
    {
      "start": 68.0,
      "end": 69.16,
      "text": "It's simply a starting point."
    },
    {
      "start": 70.06,
      "end": 73.4,
      "text": "That massive processing ability is also applied to medical imaging."
    },
    {
      "start": 74.42,
      "end": 77.82,
      "text": "Doctors examining breast scans search for subtle, hard-to-spot signs."
    },
    {
      "start": 78.48,
      "end": 83.2,
      "text": "In a Swedish trial involving over 100,000 women, doctors using AI found"
    },
    {
      "start": 83.2,
      "end": 85.44,
      "text": "more cancers than those working without it."
    },
    {
      "start": 86.02,
      "end": 87.62,
      "text": "This panel illustrates the partnership."
    },
    {
      "start": 88.82,
      "end": 93.56,
      "text": "The AI flags patterns that deserve a closer look, highlighting areas on the scan."
    },
    {
      "start": 94.54,
      "end": 97.34,
      "text": "Then, human doctors review that data to decide on care."
    },
    {
      "start": 98.48,
      "end": 103.86,
      "text": "The technology is an advanced magnifying glass, highlighting critical details so physicians"
    },
    {
      "start": 103.86,
      "end": 106.38,
      "text": "can apply their expertise to the final diagnosis."
    },
    {
      "start": 107.32,
      "end": 113.18,
      "text": "This graphic shows how computational scale applies to daily routines, reading a menu or"
    },
    {
      "start": 113.18,
      "end": 117.58,
      "text": "a street sign is effortless for many, but a constant barrier for the visually impaired."
    },
    {
      "start": 118.58,
      "end": 121.14,
      "text": "Here, a phone camera brings a carton into view."
    },
    {
      "start": 121.86,
      "end": 124.32,
      "text": "The AI recognizes the text and reads it aloud."
    },
    {
      "start": 125.22,
      "end": 130.42,
      "text": "Granting a person reliable, independent access to their environment provides a deeply meaningful"
    },
    {
      "start": 130.42,
      "end": 131.16,
      "text": "daily benefit."
    },
    {
      "start": 132.12,
      "end": 137.46,
      "text": "Moving from individual routines to community safety, this evacuation warning shows what"
    },
    {
      "start": 137.46,
      "end": 139.88,
      "text": "happens when time is the most critical asset."
    },
    {
      "start": 140.6,
      "end": 146.84,
      "text": "AI helps provide flood warnings days ahead, reliably and for free, even in regions lacking"
    },
    {
      "start": 146.84,
      "end": 148.0,
      "text": "physical river sensors."
    },
    {
      "start": 148.96,
      "end": 153.76,
      "text": "That advanced notice translates into action, letting people gather belongings and safely"
    },
    {
      "start": 153.76,
      "end": 155.3,
      "text": "evacuate before the water arrives."
    },
    {
      "start": 156.06,
      "end": 159.36,
      "text": "Across all these fields, the core mechanism is the same."
    },
    {
      "start": 160.58,
      "end": 161.7,
      "text": "Scientists get a starting point."
    },
    {
      "start": 162.7,
      "end": 164.4,
      "text": "Doctors get help finding something important."
    },
    {
      "start": 165.06,
      "end": 168.84,
      "text": "People get access to information, and communities get time to prepare."
    },
    {
      "start": 169.52,
      "end": 171.6,
      "text": "These are making a difference in people's lives."
    },
    {
      "start": 172.72,
      "end": 175.92,
      "text": "As this banner states, the big upside is happening today."
    },
    {
      "start": 176.84,
      "end": 180.28,
      "text": "AI is already accelerating work that protects and improves lives."
    }
  ],
